     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Dear all, <div><br></div><div>I encountered what may be a bug. It seems impossible to suppress the ylab when using geom_density</div><div><br></div><div>library(ggplot2)</div><div>x &lt;- rnorm(100)</div><div>qplot(x, stat=&#39;density&#39;) + labs(x=NULL, y=NULL)</div><div><br></div><div>This functions well for the x axis, but not for the y axis. </div><div><br></div><div>Regards, </div><div><br></div><div>Matthieu</div><div><br></div><div><br><div> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><b>Matthieu Dubois</b></div><div>Post-doctoral fellow</div><div><br></div><div><i>Psychology and NeuroCognition Lab (CNRS UMR 5105)<span style=\"font-style:normal\"></span></i></div><div><i>Université Pierre Mendès-France</i></div><div><i>BP47 --- 38040 Grenoble Cedex 9 --- France</i></div><div><br></div><div><i>Email: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">matthie...@upmf-grenoble.fr</a></i></div><div><i>Gmail: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">matt...@gmail.com</a></i></div><div><i><a href=\"http://web.upmf-grenoble.fr/LPNC/membre_matthieu_dubois\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://web.upmf-grenoble.fr/LPNC/membre_matthieu_dubois&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792385721445000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3U5GqZpCTJwzhLomHXGsCp\">http://web.upmf-grenoble.fr/LPNC/membre_matthieu_dubois</a></i></div><div><br></div></div></span><br></div></span><br> </div><br></div></div>"
